Clean-room protocol and documentation sources
==============================================

This package was implemented from project documentation describing the ez Share HTTP interface:

* docs/integration/hms-cpap-ezshare-integration.md
* docs/integration/resmed_bluetooth_research.md
* openspec/changes/cpap-ezshare-ingest/{proposal,design,tasks}.md

The interface used is GET /dir?dir=... for HTML listings and GET /download?file=... for file bytes.
No hms-cpap or OSCAR implementation code was copied or consulted for this package. Python standard-library
modules are the only runtime dependencies. ResMed and ez Share names identify their respective products;
no affiliation or endorsement is implied.
